// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Thunderhead 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1698263434" "Jim 'Thunderhead' Bartlett was one of the greatest American heroes of World War II. He's not as young as he used to be, but he still knows a thing or two about busting bad guys."
// DisplayClassName :
"P2664220932" "Boss"
// GroupDescription :
"P814982104" "Retired Hero"
// DisplayNames :
