// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1875105952" "This esteemed scientist was captured by the Devouring Earth. His partner, Dr. Theron, is still missing."
// DisplayNames :
"P2982614892" "Professor Lovelethe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Ambassador_Alwani 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2224078073" "Ambassador Alwani hails from the small country of West Libertalia. If you don't get him out of here, the Sky Raiders will assassinate him."
// GroupDescription :
"P2315246880" "Diplomat"
// DisplayNames :
"P2414583843" "Ambassador Alwani"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_The_American_Ambassador 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1452632540" "This American ambassador wasn't looking for trouble when he went to meet Ambassador Alwani of West Libertalia. If you can't get him out of here, he'll probably be killed to cover up the assassination of Alwani."
// DisplayNames :
"P549873986" "The American Diplomat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_General_Z 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P614255941" "You're not exactly certain what General Z is doing at this meeting. The only thing you know is that the Sky Raiders seem to want him dead."
// GroupDescription :
"P2146571422" "Soldier"
// DisplayNames :
"P406777899" "General Z"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_General_Aarons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1763333913" "The mysterious General Z has been revealed as General Aarons. His assistance has been invaluable to you, but if the Sky raiders have their way, it may well cost him his life."
// DisplayNames :
"P657949036" "General Aarons"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Akarist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1355164411" "This Circle mage gone rogue seems to be trustworthy. Certainly he's provided you with a lot of solid information. But you have to wonder whether you can really trust a man who lives in another person's body."
// GroupDescription :
"P1174607862" "Circle of Thorns"
// DisplayNames :
"P1815807871" "Akarist"

