// DisplayClassName :
"P1015150244" "Circle Traitor"
// GroupDescription :
"P12711891" "Longbow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Ckelkah 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1660222348" "This Rikti dignitary seems more open-minded than most of the strange, militant aliens. She may be the best hope for peace between humans and Rikti."
// GroupDescription :
"P4183855856" "Rikti"
// DisplayNames :
"P4137336849" "C'Kelkah"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_The_Fortune_Teller 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1098773742" "If allowed to remain in the hands of the Circle, it's very likely this fortune teller could be forced to give up information that would bring Paragon City to ruin. She has a reputation for extremely accurate predictions."
// GroupDescription :
"P241750615" "Mystics"
// DisplayNames :
"P868289506" "The Fortune Teller"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_DrTodd 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3196753589" "Dr. Roberta Todd is Paragon City's preeminent scientist in the field of Kinetics. She's learned a trick or two in the lab that may come in handy here."
// DisplayNames :
"P1706345559" "Dr. Roberta Todd"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Waylon_McCrane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3772868919" "Adventurer and self-proclaimed hero Waylon McCrane was hired by the village of Salamanca to stop the strange goings on in the woods. He's gotten himself in a bit over his head, but he's still an impressive shot with a bow."
// GroupDescription :
"P3010815058" "Adventurer"
// DisplayNames :
"P179151583" "Waylan McCrane"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Pet_Monkey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1492112535" "These Rikti monkeys have been captured by Crey Industries for scientific experimentation. You must extract the little beasts before Crey figures out a way to bioengineer them."
// DisplayNames :
"P47271606" "Rikti Monkey"
// DisplayNames :
"P529587519" "Wild Rikti Monkey"
// DisplayNames :
"P706549571" "Vicious Rikti Monkey"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Pet_Rikti_Monkey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2123221482" "These Rikti Monkeys were once regular people or pets who were horribly mutated by the effects of Rikti experimentation. Now they are little more than vicious animals!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Hwarang 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1318706235" "Kil-ja 'Kit' Sung is a young Korean-American who ignored her past for most of her life. She immersed herself in the modern age and all types of gadgets and technology. That all changed when she was visited by one of her ancestor spirits. Her ancestor Jun-tak, was a great warrior in his time and a master archer. Jun-tak explained that a time of great trouble must be met by all righteous warriors. He presented Kil-ja with a mystic bow of great power and sent her to Paragon City to carry on the grand tradition of her family. Kit has not fully accepted her role as Flower Knight, but between the advice of her ancestor, the power of his mystic bow, and her expertise with gadgets she is destined to be a mighty heroine in the City of Heroes."
// GroupDescription :
"P2746236723" "Ally"
// DisplayNames :
"P4168547382" "Hwarang"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - NPC_Pets_Walter_Daschle_NPC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3683959044" "Walter Daschle isn't the world's most powerful mystic, but he does have an uncanny knack for summoning creatures and binding them to his cause."
// DisplayClassName :
"P3157267805" "Mystic"
// DisplayNames :
"P1695496459" "Walter Daschle"

